Dear Kaylan,

the prediction SE will be a function of the SE of the parameter estimates that go into that prediction, and these seem pretty small, too, for some reason. So you seem lucky in that everything is estimated highly precisely and hence, with a small SE.

Actually, I wonder whether there is perhaps some hidden pseudoreplication ? What's the number of sites and reps in your analysis ?

Regards  --  Marc

